WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
I counted the potatoes. Counting once and believing it isn't reasoning.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
How many times is this now?

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Fourth. It takes eleven before I trust it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Sir, that was four counts. Four pages coming right up.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
I was under the impression counting was free.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Fifth. Hold on, one just rolled off.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Recount. That's one more page.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Eleventh pass. I have it. Twenty-eight.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
There is more invoice here than potato.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Count it in here. On our own ground you can count a hundred times and nothing ticks.

